    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d238-a3">

                <pb facs="0404" n="308" sameAs="frus:frus1872p1/pg308"/>

                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 3 in No. 366.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Florence</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1871-07-06"><hi rendition="#italic">July</hi> 6,
                        1871</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Gentlemen</hi>: Returning from Rome I find yours of
                    the 1st instant, and will immediately bring the subject to the attention of the
                    Italian government.</p>
                <p>Before I can take any specific steps, however, I must have definite information
                    as to– <list>
                        <label>1st.</label>
                        <item>The nationality of the owners of the petroleum shipped.</item>
                        <label>2d.</label>
                        <item>The time of shipment.</item>
                        <label>3d.</label>
                        <item>The nationality of the vessel by which the cargoes are shipped.</item>
                        <label>4th.</label>
                        <item>The quality and quantity of the article, and the., amount of duty
                            levied upon it.</item>
                    </list></p>
                <pb facs="0405" n="309" xml:id="pg309"/>
                <p>I can interfere in no case unless it is susceptible of proof that the petroleum
                    is exported solely on account of shippers of American nationality.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>GEORGE P. MARSH.</signed>
                </closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Messrs. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Granet, Brown</hi> &amp; Co. <hi
                            rendition="#italic">Genoa.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
